    "en": {
      "trackName": "Naughty Duck !",
      "description": "Hey! I'm the naughty duck. I'm here to help you pass the time and enjoy! There is an evil farmer whom I stole some cucumbers and corn from, and he decided to kill me. But guess what. I DON'T CARE. With your help, I can run away from him!\n\nThanks.",
      "releaseNotes": "Hi! This is the naughtiest duck ever!\nI have exciting new things for you!\n\nFarmer's Revenge — the farmer fights back with fireballs. Dodge them and survive as long as you can!\n\nDuck Impact — a brand-new shooter! Fly up and down, pelt the rival ducks with eggs, and take down the boss duck.\n\nPlus polish across all the games. Now get quacking!",
